{"unit_id":"tag:040S:statement","translation":"关于几何的景（sites）的点（points）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>定理<REF_0001>说明，<MATH_0001>的点（points）组成的族（family），由<MATH_0002>的几何点（geometric points）给出（引理<REF_0002>），是保守的（conservative），见景（Sites）定义<REF_0003>。特别地，<MATH_0003>有足够多的点（enough points）。\n<STRUCT_0003>设<MATH_0004>为大（big）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）景（site）上的层（sheaf）\n<LOCKED_0001>\n，其定义于<MATH_0005>上。设<MATH_0006>为大（big）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）景（site）的对象（object），这里是对<MATH_0007>而言，设<MATH_0008>为<MATH_0009>的几何点（geometric point）。于是，我们将<MATH_0010>定义为限制（restriction）<MATH_0011>的茎（stalk），这里是将<MATH_0012>限于小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）景（site），即<MATH_0013>上的这一景。换言之，我们可以定义<MATH_0014>在茎（stalk）处的取值，这里取任意概形（scheme）<MATH_0015>的任意几何点（geometric point）处。\n<STRUCT_0004>大（big）平展（<ACCENT_0004>tale）景（site），它属于<MATH_0016>，也有足够多的点（enough points），只需考虑这个景（site）的所有对象（objects）的所有几何点（geometric points），见（<REF_0004>）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"geometric points","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"conservative","target_term":"保守的"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"enough points","target_term":"足够多的点"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"stalk","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"stalk","target_term":"茎"},{"sourc